    "en": {
      "trackName": "Car Racing for Watch",
      "description": "Get ready for an adrenaline rush right on your wrist! Car Racing for Watch brings the excitement of speed racing directly to your Apple Watch. Whether you have a few minutes to spare or just want a quick dose of competitive fun, this game is designed for instant play.\n\nDive into fast-paced action and experience the thrill of the race, anytime, anywhere. Navigate your car through challenges with intuitive controls optimized for your watch. It’s the perfect way to satisfy your need for speed without reaching for your phone.\n\nKey Features:\n•  **Wrist-Top Racing:** Enjoy compact, engaging car races directly on your Apple Watch.\n•  **Instant Play:** Quick sessions perfect for short breaks and on-the-go fun.\n•  **Simple Controls:** Easy-to-learn mechanics designed for the watch interface.\n•  **Challenge Yourself:** Aim for the best times and master the tracks.\n•  **Designed for Apple Watch:** Optimized for performance and battery life on your device.\n\nDownload Car Racing for Watch today and start your engines!",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/car-racing-for-watch/id6802456419?uo=4",
